# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset
#
# Receipt images ARE committed: the benchmark is not reproducible without the
# inputs it was measured on, and the submission requires them.
#
# THIS MAKES REDACTION NON-OPTIONAL. Git history is permanent -- deleting an
# image in a later commit does not remove it from the repository. Before the
# first push, confirm every image has phone numbers, personal names, account
# numbers and Aadhaar/PAN covered. See dataset/README.md.
#
# Note there is deliberately no blanket *.jpg / *.png rule here. A global
# image ignore is the usual reason a dataset silently fails to upload, and it
# would also swallow the screenshots in docs/images/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Legacy upload location. UPLOAD_DIR used to point here; images belong in
# dataset/bills/. Use backend/scripts/relocate_uploads.py to consolidate.
tmp/
.DS_Store

# Nothing under dataset/ is ignored. The images and the answer key are both
# part of the deliverable — the benchmark is not reproducible without them.

